{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "001tom_401_2_4_001_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4f4973c0e20cba19c51206e9eb1d2c23e33effc2691ec4ded91a2277ad3facc3",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:001tom_401_2_4_001_01_09_a:2_4_001_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb16dc689461723d3732b3fc6ab545823fa1458c90e8350469121f555e093af2",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー？\n辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_401_2_4_001_01_09_a:2_4_001_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd40e21188e298849540001a2eb763b6f8bee625fcb49ba1ef36d0528e635675",
      "text": "演唱会的热度还完全没退去，\n忍不住就打电话过来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_401_2_4_001_01_09_a:2_4_001_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61aa053a57837578b6cbdf32d3eac8d8413253e23898463ffc1853313a42437b",
      "text": "再次跟你说一声，前几天的演唱会辛苦了！\n在●●●●プロデューサー看来觉得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_401_2_4_001_01_09_a:2_4_001_01_09_a:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93df88add9d0eeab8c38b4b0ad8a0bbc4b167f0dafadcba7255d7ce98a0ab604",
      "text": "太棒了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_401_2_4_001_01_09_a:2_4_001_01_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d53ba719ff2d7b1733b2e96c587380fbd0ff8c1b8e20112f157cc5db9fbcf07",
      "text": "嘿嘿，是吧？\n毕竟可是我天濑冬马的独唱啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_401_2_4_001_01_09_a:2_4_001_01_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5928ff9d94852dc64bcf2ec2ccac059033401526631850602759d629bea1937b",
      "text": "那之后，翔太和北斗也联系我了哦。\n说SNS上的留言太厉害了，让我去看看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_401_2_4_001_01_09_a:2_4_001_01_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:903a20a090549f5fa13e49a4ffe609573452988a8f1e24b6c63f9fc8c0c6c90c",
      "text": "看了感想，发现有不少人写着\n“也想去Jupiter的演唱会看看！”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_401_2_4_001_01_09_a:2_4_001_01_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e732d27f9e8c3674557e71267d0fad1596ca14236b76c04e958519dcde1bee85",
      "text": "看了我的演出，进而对我们也\n产生了兴趣，这让我超级开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_401_2_4_001_01_09_a:2_4_001_01_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d092777135e400d8d7bb908f5d85177e8660a9b8bd334a3be727566173601dc9",
      "text": "毕竟正因为是3个人，才有着能做到的表演嘛。\n真想让他们看一看啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_401_2_4_001_01_09_a:2_4_001_01_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed286d28c47703cc9c501ce5b26bb29dd63df07e3c8fc4a9856eb5d930ca75cf",
      "text": "为此，我也要更加努力。\n借我一份力量吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_401_2_4_001_01_09_a:2_4_001_01_09_a:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81626dead220ceb85daab08769551b8b46bfc1490624e6ec31b9493b3882894d",
      "text": "今后也请多关照啦，●●●●プロデューサー！\n那就明天见啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
